> /help               commands and key bindings
  /new                start a new session
  /sessions           pick a session to continue
  /rename <title>     rename the current session
  /model <id>         switch model by id; bare /model opens the picker
  /models             pick a model across configured providers
  /reasoning <level>  reasoning effort, from the next turn on
  /compact            summarize older context (idle only)
  /image <path>       attach an image to the next message
  /verbose            toggle the information tier (same as Ctrl+O)
  /status             session, model, usage and the tool lineup
  /config             effective configuration and its source layers
  /quit               leave the session
